      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for pointing this out, I was totally misunderstanding this.\n\n\u003e as there are no ordering constraints between netd updates and call to the getter. \n\nI think there is a order constrains between getter and reportNetworkActive.\nAfter client received onNetworkActive callback, user should get true from isDefaultNetworkActive.\nIn this case, we can not just use volatile?",
